OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome light scattered showers,
OL,6,Fmainly during the morning and in the
OL,7,Fwest, but Inverness mainly dry and
OL,8,Fseeing the best of the afternoon
OL,9,Fbrighter and temperatures. West to
OL,10,Fsouthwest breezes, occasionally
OL,11,Ffreshening across the coasts and
OL,12,FIslands.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThickening cloud heralding
OL,15,Fperiods of rain that reach the western
OL,16,Fcoasts and Isles late evening, before
OL,17,Ffollowing to all overnight with
OL,18,Fheavier outbreaks in west and
OL,19,Fstrengthening winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
