OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FWet, windy start with rain
OL,6,Fturning heavy at times early in west.
OL,7,FRain progressively more patchy through
OL,8,Fmorning, leading to a mainly dry
OL,9,Fafternoon with some brighter spells in
OL,10,Feast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,13,Fmainly dry with light winds and sunny
OL,14,Fspells best in east. Monday wet and
OL,15,Foccasionally windy with the east in
OL,16,Fbest of shelter. Tuesday showery.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
